# DHAN GAME

A virtual color trading website demo with a premium dashboard and admin controls.

## Features
- Responsive landing page
- Color prediction game layout
- Wallet and activity panel
- Winning history table
- Admin dashboard with user management summary
- Custom DHAN GAME logo

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open `http://localhost:3000` in your browser.

## Notes
This project is a demo/virtual-points website for UI and gameplay concept validation. It is not a real-money trading or gambling application.
